+"@moonshot-ai/kimi-code": patch
+---
+
+Report provider wait states over ACP session updates (awaiting first token; retry attempt N/M with the backoff delay), and give provider requests an explicit 120s pre-headers timeout with SDK-internal retries disabled so a hung attempt fails fast into the visible retry loop instead of sitting against the 10-minute SDK default.
